# Dev feedback log — local iteration chatter, not project history.
# Anchored to the root: an unanchored `feedback/` also swallows
# app/dev/feedback/, which is source.
/feedback/

# Web-ready media. Lives in R2, not in git — every re-encode would otherwise
# be a permanent blob in history, and we expect to iterate on these. The
# Worker serves /media/* from the bucket in production; Vite serves this
# directory in dev. Regenerate with `bun run media`. See plans/media.md.
/public/media/

# Misc
*.tsbuildinfo
